{{!--
  Idiomatic Handlebars -- fragment-heavy card partial (nests badge + price).

  Patterns followed, from the engines' own documentation:
    Handlebars language   https://handlebarsjs.com/guide/
    Handlebars.Net        https://github.com/Handlebars-Net/Handlebars.Net#readme

  Uses `{{#each}}` blocks with `this`, `{{#if}}`/`{{else if}}` chains, partial blocks
  (`{{#> layout}}` with `{{> @partial-block}}`), and registered partials. Raw triple-mustaches
  appear only where the value genuinely IS an HTML fragment; plain text goes through the
  default encoder, which is what the guide teaches. Checked by the functional verifier.
--}}

<article class="card"><h3>{{name}}</h3>{{> badge promo}}{{> price promo}}<p class="v">{{value}}</p></article>
